        "functionCode": "// Get current time and 48 hours ago in milliseconds\nconst now = new Date();\nconst twentyFourHoursAgo = new Date(now.getTime() - 48 * 60 * 60 * 1000);\n\n// Filter items where isoDate is within the last 24 hours\nreturn items.filter(item => {\n  const pubDate = new Date(item.json.isoDate);\n  return pubDate >= twentyFourHoursAgo && pubDate <= now;\n});"
